We demonstrate that the universal simplicial collection constitutes a simplicial group.  
This affirmation implies a few additional points:  
(1) the universal simplicial $n$-simplex is an associative associative-associative algebra;  
(2) the universal simplicial category forms an associative associative-associative 2-category;  
(3) the universal simplicial operad is an associative associative-associative operad;  
However, we are unable to establish that the universal simplicial monoidal category is an associative associative-associative monoidal 2-category.
